              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïkany otini kisïwa pipö Misri lö kingwanit kömöy, kïrirchï Parao lö tetö chane omisyö, wölo kïlenchï Parao, “Ape wölo mi Yosep agh kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo mwowokwa nyinte.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïtasa kömöyunay kïngwanit akïghömï ngwïny kïmïkul, kïlenyona kïyat Yosep töpoton löwïr, akwolchï omisyewut pipö Misri, ompöwölo kökingwanit kömöy korononi pö Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 41:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amöchonicha opïn, kipka piko koroswe walaka Misri wölo mi Yosep tökwal omisyö, ompöwölo kingwanit atoni kömöy tya ompö ngwïny kïmïkul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.41.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.41.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
